  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sri Lanka Education Sector Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Sri Lanka Education Sector Development Grant (ESDG) will support the GOSL Education Sector Development Framework and Program (ESDFP) 2006-2010.  The Project&apos;s overall objective is to:  (a) promote equitable access to basic education (grades 1-9) and secondary education (grades 10-13);(b) improve the quality of education, (c) enhance the economic efficiency and equity of resource allocation and distribution within the education system, and (d) strengthen education governance and service delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
